  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/wbjee/o9QDJD9ptfoSmcd2ezmvfMMhx6PLncvwB9w7hkCdHKI.original.fullsize.png\"><br>\nMinimum current $=10 \\mathrm{~mA}\\left(\\mathrm{I}_{\\mathrm{L}}=0\\right)$\n$$\n\\mathrm{R}_{\\mathrm{S}}=\\frac{\\mathrm{V}}{\\mathrm{l}}=\\frac{4 \\mathrm{~V}}{10 \\mathrm{~mA}}=400 \\Omega\n$$",
